## Implemented Features

### Authentication

- Registration with name, email, and password.
- Login with credentials.
- JWT-backed sessions.
- Logout.
- Protected route access.
- Password hashing with bcryptjs.
- Tested account uniqueness and input validation.

### Task Management

- Create tasks through the task form.
- Read tasks through server-rendered pages and API routes.
- Update tasks through the task form.
- Delete tasks through the task list.
- Complete and restore tasks.
- Set title, description, category, priority, status, due date, due time, reminder, recurrence, importance, and notes.
- Search, filter, and sort tasks in the task list.
- Keep task ownership scoped to the authenticated user.

### Categories

- Retrieve user-owned categories.
- Create categories.
- Delete categories.
- Category names are validated and limited in length.
- Category colors are validated as hexadecimal colors.

### Navigation and Views

- Dashboard
- My Tasks
- Today
- Upcoming
- Calendar
- Categories
- Completed
- Productivity
- Settings
- Profile
- Responsive application sidebar and mobile menu
- Light and dark theme provider

### Product Analytics

- Real task counts are read from Prisma.
- Completion, pending, overdue, and high-priority counts are calculated from task data.
- The current analytics UI still contains placeholder chart values and should be connected to real task history before being considered complete.

